---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /work.html
title: Fraunhofer Projects
nav: research
description: VERUM, NiKoLaS, ADAM, and ENGEL - collaborative Fraunhofer IVI projects in perception, mapping, and near-ground aerial autonomy, with Taehyoung Kim’s contributions.
---
{% from 'motion-media.njk' import motionMedia %}
<section class="container work-heading" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="work-heading-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Applied research / Fraunhofer IVI</p>
    <h1 id="work-title">From research<br>to flight<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="work-lead">The projects behind my work on perception, mapping, and near-ground aerial autonomy.</p>
    <p>At Fraunhofer IVI, I work in collaborative research projects that connect algorithms with sensors, robotic systems, and field demonstrations. Here is a closer look at what each project sets out to do and my part in it.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ work.overviewUrl }}">IVI’s autonomous flight research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <nav class="work-directory" aria-label="Fraunhofer projects">
    <p class="eyebrow">Explore the projects</p>
    {% for project in work.projects %}
    <a href="#{{ project.id }}"><span><strong>{{ project.name }}</strong><span>{{ project.theme }}</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
</section>
<section class="container work-projects" aria-label="Project details">
  {% for project in work.projects %}
  <article class="work-project" id="{{ project.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ project.id }}-title">
    <header class="work-project-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">0{{ loop.index }} / {{ project.theme }}</p><h2 id="{{ project.id }}-title">{{ project.name }}<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p class="work-tagline">{{ project.tagline }}</p></div>
      <div class="work-project-meta"><span class="work-status work-status--{{ project.statusKey }}">{{ project.status }}</span><p>{{ project.period }}</p></div>
    </header>
    <div class="work-project-body">
      <div class="work-objective"><h3>About the project</h3><p>{{ project.summary }}</p><ul class="work-focus" aria-label="{{ project.name }} focus areas">{% for focus in project.focus %}<li>{{ focus }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><div class="resource-links">{% for source in project.sources %}<a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% if project.preview %}<figure class="work-map-preview">{{ motionMedia('', project.preview.alt, project.preview, project.name, false, false) }}<figcaption>{{ project.preview.caption }}</figcaption></figure>{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="work-contribution{% if not project.contributions.length %} work-contribution--pending{% endif %}"><h3>My contribution</h3>
        {% if project.contributions.length %}<ul>{% for item in project.contributions %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p class="work-contribution-placeholder">More on my work here soon.</p>{% endif %}
        {% if project.outputs %}<div class="work-outputs"><h4>Research outputs</h4><div class="resource-links">{% for output in project.outputs %}<a href="{{ output.url }}">{{ output.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endif %}
        {% if project.collaborators %}<div class="work-collaborators">{% for collaborator in project.collaborators %}<p>{{ collaborator.role }}: <a href="{{ collaborator.url }}">{{ collaborator.name }}</a></p>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if project.photos %}<div class="work-gallery">{% for photo in project.photos %}<img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" width="480" height="300" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{% endfor %}</div><p class="work-gallery-caption">ADAM final presentation and demonstration flights · October 2026</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
  <div class="work-notes"><p>Collaborative projects at Fraunhofer IVI. Project descriptions and periods are drawn from the linked public sources; dates refer to the consortium’s work. Updated {{ work.updated }}.</p><a class="text-link" href="/publications.html">Explore my publications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>
